B.Fu=new A.aE("note","Half-Burnt Note","boiler",1,"Fished from the furnace grate: \u201c...she signs TOMORROW. It must be tonight, at eleven. I shall fetch it up; you bring her down. Burn this.\u201d Unsigned, on thick cream paper with a silver \u201cS\u201d monogram.",B.Gn,B.DP)
