B.N1=new A.oy("cake","The Twelve-Year Fruitcake",B.TT,B.Ju,B.HL,B.L_,B.My,"Thirty years ago Mrs. Senclair built her fortune on Penny Cotta's cream puff recipe and never paid her a cube; now she meant to retire Penny without notice. Penny's alibi was a souffl\xe9 \u2014 but it was never baked last night. The oven was cold and the eggs untouched, and Barry saw an empty kitchen at eleven. At 11:05 she struck Mrs. Senclair in the cellar with the rock-hard Christmas fruitcake, leaving a drip of her own sauce beneath the body, then \u201cfound\u201d her in the morning. The chess players were heard throughout, Tira was on the telephone, and Barry was locked outside.",B.Jg)
